          "promptGuidance": "Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, inspired by Vietnamese chữ Nôm manuscript and woodblock conventions rather than Japanese sumi-e, with lampblack #241D19, vermilion #A33A2A, old gold #B7863B and indigo #364A5C under soft window light, no text or lettering.",
